  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "The query is 1-aminoadamantane (amantadine), a small lipophilic primary amine. Multiple high-transfer human oral bioavailability measurements for diverse small-molecule drugs (nemonoxacin ~100%, minocycline 90–100%, gabapentin ~60%, cocaine 20–60%) support F ≥20%. The only low-F evidence (amphotericin B) reflects a large polyene macrolide with permeability/solubility liabilities not shared by the query. Therefore predict high.",
